{
    "title": "Dead Raid \u2014 Zombie Shooter 3D",
    "description": "Hey! Here is a zombie shooter. Are you sure you're right for the role of a zombie killer?\r\n\r\nPsst... Hear that? Zombies are nearby. Stay sharp and don't freak out! Shaky hands won't do you any good. Grip your weapon like your life depends on it and aim straight to keep those walking creeps at bay.\r\n____________\r\n\r\nAre you a fan of thrilling, heart-racing, and hair-raising zombie apocalypse games? If so, then you don't want to miss out on our Dead Raid: Zombie Shooter 3D. Our first-person shooter game is perfect for those seeking atmospheric and action-packed survival shooting games.\r\n\r\nAs the only survivor, you must fend off the hungry monsters that roam the corridors of the buildings and the streets of the city. These monsters were once ordinary folks, until they were turned into insatiable zombies. You can stop their brutal attacks in two ways \u2014 with your own flesh or by feeding them lead bullets (or arrows). The simple rule of the game is to kill zombies, move forward, and survive against this horde of the walking dead.\r\n\r\nBe quick in this game, or your character will be devoured by growling zombies! You'll be nothing but a tasty morsel in the eyes of these walking creatures. Do you really want to turn into a snack for bloodthirsty monsters? Then pick your weapon wisely \u2014 choose what works best for you (you need to try all the options). As you progress from level to level, you'll gain access to a wider variety of weapons \u2014 pistols, shotguns, rifles, crossbows, and more. Choose a weapon that looks good to you - and dive into a real horror movie! Don't forget to upgrade your gun, as it can shoot faster and deadlier, which greatly increases your chances of survival.\r\n\r\nWe're smack in the middle of the apocalypse and forced to fight against the zombies in the fog. Of course, seeing these horrors, you'd want to be in a bunker or some other safe haven, but then it wouldn't be an action-survival horror story and shooter.\r\n\r\nMustard up your courage for this horror shooting game and go shoot some zombies! Aim like a real sniper, and don't forget to reload, as cartridges have a habit of running out at the most inconvenient moment. Your accurate shooting will feed the walking dead with bullets (or arrows) and discourage any desire to dine with you. If your accuracy leaves much to be desired, they'll have a feast, much to the delight of the zombies.\r\n\r\nFirearms in your hands are great, but why not use your wits \u2014 another advantage you have over these crazy gluttons? Instead of wasting clip after clip, aim and detonate the fire extinguisher to take out as many undead as you can with one shot. If you run out of ammo and the zombie is close, shoot them in the leg. That way, they'll slow down, and you'll have time to reload.\r\n\r\nThe zombie hunt is on! Clear territories one by one to test yourself on new levels. Act fast and accurate \u2014 your life's on the line. Don't let your guard down or you'll end up as the next victim of the zombie apocalypse.\r\n____________\r\n\r\nAll zombies in our shooter are strictly 18+, participating in the game voluntarily, and have given verbal consent to be shot.\r\n\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:  https://aigames.ae/policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Hey! Here is a zombie shooter. Are you sure you&#39;re right for the role of a zombie killer?<br><br>Psst... Hear that? Zombies are nearby. Stay sharp and don&#39;t freak out! Shaky hands won&#39;t do you any good. Grip your weapon like your life depends on it and aim straight to keep those walking creeps at bay.<br>____________<br><br>Are you a fan of thrilling, heart-racing, and hair-raising zombie apocalypse games? If so, then you don&#39;t want to miss out on our Dead Raid: Zombie Shooter 3D. Our first-person shooter game is perfect for those seeking atmospheric and action-packed survival shooting games.<br><br>As the only survivor, you must fend off the hungry monsters that roam the corridors of the buildings and the streets of the city. These monsters were once ordinary folks, until they were turned into insatiable zombies. You can stop their brutal attacks in two ways \u2014 with your own flesh or by feeding them lead bullets (or arrows). The simple rule of the game is to kill zombies, move forward, and survive against this horde of the walking dead.<br><br>Be quick in this game, or your character will be devoured by growling zombies! You&#39;ll be nothing but a tasty morsel in the eyes of these walking creatures. Do you really want to turn into a snack for bloodthirsty monsters? Then pick your weapon wisely \u2014 choose what works best for you (you need to try all the options). As you progress from level to level, you&#39;ll gain access to a wider variety of weapons \u2014 pistols, shotguns, rifles, crossbows, and more. Choose a weapon that looks good to you - and dive into a real horror movie! Don&#39;t forget to upgrade your gun, as it can shoot faster and deadlier, which greatly increases your chances of survival.<br><br>We&#39;re smack in the middle of the apocalypse and forced to fight against the zombies in the fog. Of course, seeing these horrors, you&#39;d want to be in a bunker or some other safe haven, but then it wouldn&#39;t be an action-survival horror story and shooter.<br><br>Mustard up your courage for this horror shooting game and go shoot some zombies! Aim like a real sniper, and don&#39;t forget to reload, as cartridges have a habit of running out at the most inconvenient moment. Your accurate shooting will feed the walking dead with bullets (or arrows) and discourage any desire to dine with you. If your accuracy leaves much to be desired, they&#39;ll have a feast, much to the delight of the zombies.<br><br>Firearms in your hands are great, but why not use your wits \u2014 another advantage you have over these crazy gluttons? Instead of wasting clip after clip, aim and detonate the fire extinguisher to take out as many undead as you can with one shot. If you run out of ammo and the zombie is close, shoot them in the leg. That way, they&#39;ll slow down, and you&#39;ll have time to reload.<br><br>The zombie hunt is on! Clear territories one by one to test yourself on new levels. Act fast and accurate \u2014 your life&#39;s on the line. Don&#39;t let your guard down or you&#39;ll end up as the next victim of the zombie apocalypse.<br>____________<br><br>All zombies in our shooter are strictly 18+, participating in the game voluntarily, and have given verbal consent to be shot.<br><br><br>Privacy Policy:  https://aigames.ae/policy",
